# Build context exclusions.
#
# Without this file the whole directory is uploaded to the Docker daemon on
# every build — including `.env` (real secrets, which would then persist in the
# build cache and possibly in an image layer), `nexton.db` (the live database,
# with user rows), and `backend.exe` (a ~50 MB local build that has no business
# being in a Linux image's context).

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local database and its WAL sidecars
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Local build output
*.exe
*.exe~
*.test
/out/

# Tooling and editor state
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
.gocache/
.gomodcache/
.gotmp/

# Documentation and orchestration, not needed to compile
*.md
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
